Package: fabricatrZero
Title: Tidyverse-First Data Fabrication
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Alex", "Coppock", email = "acoppock@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Alex Coppock [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Alex Coppock <acoppock@gmail.com>
Description: A drop-in tidyverse-first replacement for fabricatr. Identical
    public API built on dplyr, tidyr, tibble, and purrr. Key improvements:
    explicit nesting via nest_level(), declare_level() for cross-classified
    data, improved draw_* defaults, and a clean multi-column output protocol.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    dplyr (>= 1.1.0),
    tibble,
    purrr,
    rlang,
    stats
Suggests:
    knitr,
    MASS,
    mvnfast,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
